  "notes": "UD-352 (category B, D-064): in orderings B1 and E1 upstream's initSolver resets the release-cached current position to X after a reader refreshed it at the current displacement release, so getCurrentPosition() and getStableTimeStep() use the undeformed mesh; the port's corrected default keeps the cache (B1: X + u, E1: the last refresh X + u_old, the direct write being invisible, UD-800 C), its compat switch init_solver_resets_current_position reproduces every value. Orderings A, D, Dp: displacement imposed without a solver step stays invisible (UD-800, reproduced)."
}
